*  1020 - CODE compiles statements; transfer to a label defined only in
*  the fragment, fragment loops internally, then gotos back to a main
*  label (manual Ch.9: fragment labels are transfer-reachable, and the
*  fragment can name main labels in its own Goto fields)
	S = 'L OUTPUT = N; N = LT(N,10) N + 1 :S(L)F(DONE)'
	N = 8
	CODE(S)	:(L)
DONE	OUTPUT = 'done'
END
